10	## 0. Mandatory Pre-Build Rules (Koda reads this before line 1 of code)
11	
12	1. `render` prop, NOT `asChild`. base-nova uses `@base-ui/react` primitives. Grep any component before wrapping with `asChild` — it will silently break.
13	2. Sidebar active state: CSS selector `[data-sidebar="menu-button"][data-active="true"]` in `globals.css`. NEVER `useSidebar()` ternaries in markup.
14	3. Active nav icon: `text-white` (NOT `text-primary` — purple on purple = invisible).
15	4. Collapsed sidebar styling: `group-data-[collapsible=icon]:*` classes only. No JS state for visual changes.
16	5. Shadows: `shadow-soft`, `shadow-card`, `shadow-soft-md` ONLY. `shadow-sm`/`shadow-md` = Sage hard-fail.
17	6. Tailwind opacity: `/8` is invalid. Use `/10` or `/[0.08]`.
18	7. All colors via CSS tokens. No raw hex except the two brand swatches already in `globals.css`.
19	8. `animationFillMode: "both"` on every staggered animation. Without it, cards flash at their final state before the animation starts.
20	9. Sidebar separators: gate with same condition as adjacent conditional element.
21	10. Duplicate nav: each destination appears in exactly ONE place (sidebar OR dropdown, never both).
